<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Chaos Engineering Report - {{ inventory_hostname }}</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 40px; background: #1a1a1a; color: #e0e0e0; }
        .container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; background: #2a2a2a; padding: 30px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
        h1 { color: #ff6b6b; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        h2 { color: #4ecdc4; border-bottom: 2px solid #4ecdc4; padding-bottom: 10px; }
        .summary { background: #333; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .chaos-type { display: inline-block; padding: 5px 15px; border-radius: 20px; margin: 5px; background: #444; }
        .network { background: #4ecdc4; color: #111; }
        .resource { background: #45b7d1; color: #111; }
        .service { background: #96ceb4; color: #111; }
        .time { background: #ffeaa7; color: #111; }
        .log { background: #1e1e1e; padding: 15px; border-radius: 5px; font-family: monospace; white-space: pre-wrap; }
        .success { color: #98d8c8; }
        .warning { color: #feca57; }
        .error { color: #ff6b6b; }
        .footer { text-align: center; margin-top: 40px; color: #888; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0; }
        th, td { padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #444; text-align: left; }
        th { background: #333; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>🎭 Chaos Engineering Report</h1>
        
        <div class="summary">
            <h2>📊 Session Summary</h2>
            <p><strong>Target Host:</strong> {{ inventory_hostname }}</p>
            <p><strong>Chaos Type:</strong> <span class="chaos-type {{ chaos_type }}">{{ chaos_type | title }}</span></p>
            <p><strong>Duration:</strong> {{ chaos_duration }} seconds</p>
            <p><strong>Started:</strong> {{ ansible_date_time.iso8601 }}</p>
            <p><strong>Operator:</strong> {{ ansible_user_id }}</p>
            <p><strong>Status:</strong> <span class="success">✅ COMPLETED</span></p>
        </div>

        <h2>🎯 Chaos Parameters</h2>
        <table>
            <tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Value</th></tr>
            {% for key, value in chaos_params.items() if value is defined %}
            <tr><td>{{ key | title }}</td><td>{{ value }}</td></tr>
            {% endfor %}
        </table>

        <h2>📝 Chaos Logs</h2>
        <div class="log">
            {% if chaos_type == 'network' %}
            Network chaos was successfully applied to {{ inventory_hostname }}.
            Effects included latency injection, packet loss simulation, and bandwidth throttling.
            All network rules have been cleaned up automatically.
            {% elif chaos_type == 'resource' %}
            Resource chaos was successfully applied to {{ inventory_hostname }}.
            Effects included CPU stress, memory pressure, and I/O throttling.
            All stress processes have been terminated automatically.
            {% elif chaos_type == 'service' %}
            Service chaos was successfully applied to {{ inventory_hostname }}.
            Effects included service restarts, temporary stops, and port blocking.
            All services have been restored automatically.
            {% elif chaos_type == 'time' %}
            Time chaos was successfully applied to {{ inventory_hostname }}.
            Effects included timezone changes, NTP manipulation, and clock drift.
            Time configuration has been restored automatically.
            {% else %}
            Random chaos scenario was executed successfully.
            Check individual chaos logs for detailed information.
            {% endif %}
        </div>

        <h2>🔧 Applied Changes</h2>
        <div class="log">
            - Traffic control rules applied and removed
            - Stress processes started and stopped
            - Service states modified and restored
            - Network configurations altered and reverted
            - Time settings changed and recovered
        </div>

        <h2>✅ Safety Checks</h2>
        <ul>
            <li class="success">✅ Target validation passed</li>
            <li class="success">✅ Critical services protected</li>
            <li class="success">✅ Automatic rollback executed</li>
            <li class="success">✅ Cleanup verification completed</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>Report generated by Nightly Ansible Chaos Orchestrator</p>
            <p>Remember: Chaos Engineering should only be performed in development environments!</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
